# Local deterministic typography acceptance. The fixture exercises the
# site-derived palette, readable measure, three heading/body roles, quote and
# list rhythm, scheme-aware link glyphs, monospace preformatting, and font
# fallback across Latin, Greek, and Japanese text.
settle 30
key escape
open gemini://127.0.0.1:19655/typography.gmi
act Toggle live content
settle 90
assert content-live
assert surface content
capture 01_typography
log smolweb typography receipt complete
